OL,3,ABank holiday weekend to see more
OL,4,Athunderstorms and rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FDownpours and thunderstorms are set to
OL,7,Fcontinue for many across the bank
OL,8,Fholiday weekend with some unseasonably
OL,9,Fstrong winds expected.
OL,11,FA yellow warning for thunderstorms on
OL,12,FFriday has been issued covering most of
OL,13,FWales, the Midlands and parts of the
OL,14,FNorth West and North East on England
OL,15,Fwith warnings that driving conditions
OL,16,Fwill be affected by spray and standing
OL,17,Fwater.
OL,19,FHeavy rain will continue to bring the
OL,20,Frisk of flash flooding with a number of
OL,21,Fflood warning and alerts already in
OL,22,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
