OL,3,ABank holiday weekend to see more
OL,4,Athunderstorms and rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Midlands has been one of the worst
OL,7,Faffected areas so far this week with in
OL,8,Fareas including Birmingham and
OL,9,FStaffordshire seeing "significant
OL,10,Fflooding".
